        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshita ine ilya basonta abantu bashifwe abakwangalila amatala umo balesungila umutuulo wa ŋanda yakwa Lesa, ukulundapofye no mutuulo wa cekumi pamo ne fisabo fyakubalilapo. Aba bantu ebalelonganika ifyamutuulo ukufuma mu mabala ayashingulwike imisumba no kufibika mu matala, ukulingana ne fipimo fyakukonka amafunde palwa kupeela kuli bashimapepo na ku bena Levi, pantu abena Yuda balisekelemo mu milimo ya batumishi iyo bashimapepo na bena Levi balebomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balebomba umulimo wakutumika Lesa no kusangulula. Bakemba na bakalinda wa mpongolo nabo bene efyo balecita ukulingana nefyo Davidi no mwana wakwe Solomoni babakonkomeshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kale line mu nshiku shakwa Davidi na Asafu kwali ntungulushi sha bakemba ne nyimbo shakulumbanya no kutatakula Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili na mu nshiku shakwa Serubabeli na Nehemia, abena Israeli bonse baletuula ifyapimwa kuli bakemba na bakalinda wa mpongolo. Kabili balipatwileko umutuulo umo uwali wa bena Levi bambi, elyo na bena Levi bapatwilapo aba mu lupwa lwakwa Aroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
